    "detailed_description": "\u25a0Bullet Hell Shmup<br />\r\n  This game is bullet hell shmup to have you satisfy with a beginner and the arcade senior player!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Exercise mode<br />\r\n  Pattern construction is the powerful charm of the bullet hell shmups, but must start from 1st stage again ?<br />\r\n  Therefore you are able to practice only each stage.<br />\r\n  Practice until you don't fail there.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0AC mode<br />\r\n  If there is confidence with an exercise mode, challenge AC mode!<br />\r\n  When let you go through all stages, and play, the stage which haven't looked at are ... ?<br />\r\n  Though do not know this gunner, who is this ... ?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0EX mode<br />\r\n  This mode is a transcendence rank mode for unsatisfactory super shooters with an AC mode.<br />\r\n  There is no allowance entirely. Please play by a self-responsibility.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0The Strategy<br />\r\n\u30fbParts destruction<br />\r\n  As well as a boss and a middle boss, many enemies have special destroyable parts.<br />\r\n  Sword item, this which are provided when you destroy specific parts of enemies become the key to capture.<br />\r\n\u30fbSorcerial Golem Mode<br />\r\n  There are many enemies who have special parts which you can destroy only in this mode.<br />\r\n  Though, you cannot destroy the normal enemies in this mode, so, let's change your ship's mode well.<br />\r\n\u30fbSword Attack<br />\r\n  If you collect sword items enough, swing Kishin-no-Tsurugi sword around!<br />\r\n  While this huge sword exits, you are completely invincible!<br />\r\n  The score improves by letting the sword make a hit consecutively!<br />\r\n\u30fbAuto Sword Guard<br />\r\n  If your sword gauge is green, only once, Kishin-no-Tsurugi sword will be activated automatically when you are bombed.",
    "about_the_game": "\u25a0Bullet Hell Shmup<br />\r\n  This game is bullet hell shmup to have you satisfy with a beginner and the arcade senior player!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0Exercise mode<br />\r\n  Pattern construction is the powerful charm of the bullet hell shmups, but must start from 1st stage again ?<br />\r\n  Therefore you are able to practice only each stage.<br />\r\n  Practice until you don't fail there.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0AC mode<br />\r\n  If there is confidence with an exercise mode, challenge AC mode!<br />\r\n  When let you go through all stages, and play, the stage which haven't looked at are ... ?<br />\r\n  Though do not know this gunner, who is this ... ?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0EX mode<br />\r\n  This mode is a transcendence rank mode for unsatisfactory super shooters with an AC mode.<br />\r\n  There is no allowance entirely. Please play by a self-responsibility.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0The Strategy<br />\r\n\u30fbParts destruction<br />\r\n  As well as a boss and a middle boss, many enemies have special destroyable parts.<br />\r\n  Sword item, this which are provided when you destroy specific parts of enemies become the key to capture.<br />\r\n\u30fbSorcerial Golem Mode<br />\r\n  There are many enemies who have special parts which you can destroy only in this mode.<br />\r\n  Though, you cannot destroy the normal enemies in this mode, so, let's change your ship's mode well.<br />\r\n\u30fbSword Attack<br />\r\n  If you collect sword items enough, swing Kishin-no-Tsurugi sword around!<br />\r\n  While this huge sword exits, you are completely invincible!<br />\r\n  The score improves by letting the sword make a hit consecutively!<br />\r\n\u30fbAuto Sword Guard<br />\r\n  If your sword gauge is green, only once, Kishin-no-Tsurugi sword will be activated automatically when you are bombed.",
